      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Squad selection",
          "heading": "Jake White delays final Fiji squad naming to assess players in Lyon",
          "body": "Kali Sewabu, Fiji Rugby's chief executive, told SUNsports that White wants a further three days to watch the squad in Lyon before deciding. White and roughly 10 players from the Japan match flew straight to Lyon, where Europe-based men including Pita Gus Sowakula, Josua Tuisova and Jiuta Wainiqolo joined them for a three-day camp. Sewabu said limited preparation time is Fiji's usual barrier, and the group regroups in Lyon after this weekend's club fixtures, depending on injuries."
        },
