          "kicker": "Ranking record",
          "heading": "France's brief reign at world No. 1 lasted just one week",
          "body": "France's longest unbroken spell at the top of the world rankings lasted one week, running from July 2022 to July 2022. Both ends of that run fall in the same month, so it was a brief stint at No. 1 rather than a sustained stay. The figure is the benchmark the app holds for the side's time at the summit, and it is a reminder of how quickly the top of the table can change hands."
