          "kicker": "Squad news",
          "heading": "Quesada names Italy squad to face South Africa in Turin",
          "body": "The Federazione has published Italy's squad for Saturday's Test in Turin, the 19th meeting between the two nations. South Africa have won 18 of those, Italy's sole success a 20-18 win in Florence in 2016, and the Springboks name their own team on Monday evening, South African time. Italy come in off a 10-57 defeat by Australia and have lost all three matches so far this campaign."
