          "heading": "Ex-Scotland winger Tim Visser pleads not guilty to charges spanning 14 years",
          "body": "Earlier reports said former Harlequins and Scotland player Tim Visser was to go on trial charged with rape. Reports now say he has entered a not guilty plea to abuse charges spanning 14 years, and the case is still before the court. No verdict has been reported, and the case stays open until one is reached. Visser is entitled to the presumption of innocence."
