      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Derby result",
          "heading": "Cardiff beat Ospreys 26-0 in Welsh derby, Tom Bowen scoring twice",
          "body": "Ospreys were kept off the scoresheet for the first time in over two years, a red-zone defensive effort that shaped Saturday's derby at St Helen's. Steff Emanuel was involved in all three first-half tries, and Tom Howe's late try at the back of the maul secured the bonus point. Despite several visits to the Cardiff 22, the hosts were unable to find a way back, and the win lifts Cardiff above the Ospreys into the top eight of the URC."
