    "465": {
      "date": "2026-11-02",
      "edition": "Monday 2 November",
      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Captaincy call",
          "heading": "Scott Barrett moves on from losing All Blacks captaincy to Ardie Savea",
          "body": "Barrett captained the All Blacks under Robertson before the role went to Ardie Savea under Dave Rennie. He told Sky Sport NZ he took inspiration from Kane Williamson, the former Black Caps captain who stepped away from leadership and kept playing. \"I reflected on other athletes who had once been captain and then sort of moved on.\" Rennie called Barrett a reluctant captain, and Barrett missed the whole Super Rugby Pacific season injured before joining the touring squad for November."
